ns-serif; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;" align=3D"center">Sept. 14, 5:4=
0 p.m., County of Kaua=CA=BBi, Hurricane Lowell Recovery Update</h2>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: calibri, candara, segoe, optima, arial, sans-se=
rif; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;">L=C4=AAHU=CA=BBE =
=E2=80=93 A week after Hurricane Lowell caused wreckage across Kaua=E2=80=
=99i, communities are moving into the next phase of recovery.</p>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: calibri, candara, segoe, optima, arial, sans-se=
rif; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;">The County is prep=
aring to open two disaster recovery resource centers for storm victims to p=
rovide vital information on how to rebuild. Meanwhile, as critical infrastr=
ucture is restored, the County will be closing two more of its Hurricane Re=
fuge Areas.</p>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: calibri, candara, segoe, optima, arial, sans-se=
rif; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;">The county has als=
o launched a new website where storm victims can find forms necessary to su=
bmit damage assessments and file for disaster tax relief.</p>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: calibri, candara, segoe, optima, arial, sans-se=
rif; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;">New assessment num=
bers show 10 homes have been destroyed and 64 suffered major damage.</p>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: calibri, candara, segoe, optima, arial, sans-se=
rif; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;">The total number o=
f resident-submitted damage assessments has surpassed 620.</p>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: calibri, candara, segoe, optima, arial, sans-se=
rif; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;">For recovery help,=
 resources and updates, visit <a href=3D"https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL=
0/https:%2F%2Fwww.kauairecovers.org%2F%3Futm_medium=3Demail%26utm_source=3D=
govdelivery/1/010101a0a328277b-e87bd6a7-8c41-4e24-8180-829169942082-000000/=
gHjaHMiALC32NWjsxWJxevbgwj2TGyV0LvgkLp02Fwc=3D452" style=3D"-webkit-text-si=
ze-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #54c8e8;">www.kauaireco=
vers.org</a>.</p>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: calibri, candara, segoe, optima, arial, sans-se=
rif; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;">For any non-emerge=
ncy information, call Aloha United Way at 211.</p>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: calibri, candara, segoe, optima, arial, sans-se=
rif; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;">=C2=A0</p>

<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: calibri, candara, segoe, optima, arial, sans-se=
rif; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Evening up=
date - at a glance</strong></p>
<ul style=3D"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
<li aria-level=3D"1" style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size=
-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: calibri, candara, segoe, opti=
ma, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin-top: 0px;">T=
